{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xunyu-e-o047a","title":"荀攸劝曹操乘袁谭袁尚争冀先取河北","accounts":[{"id":"xunyu-e-o047a-account","label":"《荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十》正文","text":"荀攸劝曹操乘袁谭袁尚争冀先取河北","evidence":["xunyu-e-o047a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0143","role":"献策","evidence":["xunyu-e-o047a-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"问策","evidence":["xunyu-e-o047a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0203","role":"请援","evidence":["xunyu-e-o047a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"黎阳征讨次年","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xunyu-e-o047a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"xunyu-e-o047a-q","source_order":[10,231,"O047a"],"order":2495}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0143","name":"荀攸","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0203","name":"辛毗","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xunyu-e-o047a-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-803c493fa656867544dc","layer":"original","quote":"明年，太祖方征刘表，谭、尚争冀州。谭遣辛毗乞降请救；太祖将许之，以问群下。群下多以为：“表强，宜先平之；谭、尚，不足忧也。”攸曰：“天下方有事，而刘表坐保江、汉之间，其无四方志可知矣〖2〗。袁氏据四州之地，带甲十万，绍以宽厚得众；借使二子和睦以守其成业〖3〗，则天下之难未息也。今兄弟遘恶〖4〗，此势不两全：若有所并，则力专；力专，则难图也。及其乱而取之，天下定矣。此时不可失也！”","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":230,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":191}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
